    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nO'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers are delighted to offer for sale a wonderful 5 bedroom detached residence in Glenina Heights. \n\nLocated in Renmore just off the main Dublin Road, this is one of Galway City's most popular residential locations.\n\nRenmore has plenty of communal green areas and facilities nearby such as Liam Mellows GAA Grounds, Galwegians Rugby Club, Kingfisher Leisure facilities, Renmore parklands, Lough Atalia playground, local community centre and the popular Ballyloughane Beach. \n\nNo. 12 Glenina Heights is a well-proportioned five bed detached residence that would benefit from some modernisation to provide the ideal family home or indeed a gilt edged investment property. \n\nBuilt c. 1967, the property offers ample accommodation throughout with approximately 149 sq.m over two stories. \n\nThe ground floor is arranged around a large welcoming entrance hall with guest wc, separate living room, dining room and a kitchen leading from here. There is a utility room off the kitchen with access to a ground floor office or 5th bedroom. \n\nUpstairs offers four substantial sized bedrooms and a main family bathroom with tub and separate shower. \n\nOutside 12 Glenina Heights offers an impressive amount of space with a gated entrance, off-street parking, separate solid garage, front and rear lawn. \n\nATU College Campus, Merlin Park Hospital and the Garda Western Region Headquarters are a 5-minute walk away. Bon Secour Private Hospital is adjacent and Merlin Park Hospital and Galway Clinic are moments away. \n\nThere are excellent primary and secondary schools in the immediate neighbourhood and an array of shops, retails parks, cafes and hotels to provide all other necessary amenities.\n\nExcellently serviced by quality transport links giving easy access to Galway city centre, neighbouring suburbs, as well as the M6 and M18 motorways. \n\n12 Glenina Heights is an ideal property for a variety of purchasers, investors or owner occupiers looking for a great property in a well-established area of Galway City. \n\nViewing is highly recommended.\n\nProperties can be viewed on our website www.odj.ie \nOFFICE OPENING HOURS - MON TO FRI 9AM TO 5:30PM\n\nNOTE: These particulars are not to be considered a formal offer. They are for information only and give a general idea of the property. They are not to be taken as forming any part of a resulting contract, nor to be relied upon as statements or representations of fact. Whilst every care is taken in their preparation, neither O'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers nor the vendor accept any liability as to their accuracy. Intending purchasers must satisfy themselves by personal inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of these particulars. No person in the employment of O'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers has any authority to make or give any representation or warranty whatever in relation to this property."
      },
